menu "Fractonica OTA"

    config FR_TEST_FAULT_HEALTH
        bool "Fault build: never pass the OTA health check"
        default n
        depends on FR_TEST_HOOKS
        help
            A fault build (spec 03 §3.8): the image never sets the CAPS health bit, so after an OTA
            its 60 s health deadline rolls it back (T-OTA). Set only by `fr build --fault health`,
            through the generated layer fr_gen/sdkconfig.fault; fr_app_desc reports it (fault = 1)
            and the hub never picks such a build implicitly. Debug builds only.

endmenu
